.pytest_cache/
dist/
*.egg-info/
# cache.db IS tracked — it carries the backfilled bike specifications.
# Its WAL sidecars are not: they are runtime state, meaningless without the exact
# .db they belong to, and they change on every read. Always checkpoint before
# committing (`pragma wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE)`) or the committed .db will be
# missing whatever is still sitting in the log.
cache.db-shm
cache.db-wal
cache.db.bak
cache.db.bak2
